(7530807, 1204201, 50695, '<td valign="top">It was a long day. The Russian bureaucrats had left almost no one alive in the old quarter, but their briefcases full of blood would not prove helpful during the night of the bubble.</td>', 'It was a long day. The Russian bureaucrats had left almost no one alive in the old quarter, but their briefcases full of blood would not prove helpful during the night of the bubble.', '2017-08-25 00:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7530808, 1204206, 50695, '<td valign="top">Everyone was lining up to walk on the sunny crosswalk. They could not get enough of the trick of disappearing. Everyone always assumes it''s a trick. Everyone thinks it''s like going on a vacation, like the world''s a stage and they''re going to appear again in the back row of the audience... but what if there is no audience? What if no one is watching us?</td>', 'Everyone was lining up to walk on the sunny crosswalk. They could not get enough of the trick of disappearing. Everyone always assumes it''s a trick. Everyone thinks it''s like going on a vacation, like the world''s a stage and they''re going to appear again in the back row of the audience... but what if there is no audience? What if no one is watching us?', '2017-08-25 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7530809, 1204176, 50695, '<td valign="top">Living Space... that was the reason given... and it seemed so, well... reasonable. We all need space to live. And that''s when Halfo Ritled colonized the Alpha moons. What he neglected to mention, and what we couldn''t see with our human eyes, was that these moons were already inhabited.</td>', 'Living Space... that was the reason given... and it seemed so, well... reasonable. We all need space to live. And that''s when Halfo Ritled colonized the Alpha moons. What he neglected to mention, and what we couldn''t see with our human eyes, was that these moons were already inhabited.', '2017-08-25 00:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7530810, 1204031, 50695, '<td valign="top">They seemed so cute at first. They were quite the trend, in fact. People actually paid a lot of money for these things. But then, somehow, everyone had one, exactly one. And no one could get rid of them.</td>', 'They seemed so cute at first. They were quite the trend, in fact. People actually paid a lot of money for these things. But then, somehow, everyone had one, exactly one. And no one could get rid of them.', '2017-08-25 00:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
